
### Test Get Room Seats - Invalid Room ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/rooms/abc/seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test Get Room Seats - Room Not Found
GET http://localhost:3001/api/rooms/999999/seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test Get Room Seats - Valid Room ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/rooms/1/seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test Add Room Seats - Invalid Room ID
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/abc/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seats": [
    {
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "seatNumber": 1,
      "displayOrder": 1
    }
  ]
}

###
### Test Add Room Seats - Room Not Found
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/999999/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seats": [
    {
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "seatNumber": 1,
      "displayOrder": 1
    }
  ]
}

###
### Test Add Room Seats - Empty Seat List
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/999999/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seats": []
}

###
### Test Add Room Seats - Row 13 Not Allowed
