### Generate Seat Layout - Invalid Room ID
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/abc/generate-seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Generate Seat Layout - Room Not Found
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/999999/generate-seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Generate Seat Layout - Valid Empty Room
# Replace 3 with the ID of an EMPTY room with capacity 100 or 200
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/rooms/3/generate-seats
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get Generated Seats
# Use the same room ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/rooms/3/seats
Content-Type: application/json

